<h2>Reset your password</h2>

<p>Hi,</p>

<p>Someone asked to reset the password for your WIT Calendar account (<strong><%= @resource.email %></strong>).</p>

<p style="margin-top: 16px;">
  <%= link_to "Reset my password", edit_password_url(@resource, reset_password_token: @token) %>
</p>

<p style="margin-top: 16px;">
  If you did not ask for this, you can ignore this email.
  Your password does not change until you open the link and set a new one.
</p>
